---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
---

<BaseLayout title="now · 抹茶味的琴" description="最近在改有径的真机问题、有据的推送链路，以及 MindType 的缓存与索引。">
  <header class="index-header shell">
    <p class="path-label"><span class="path-label__tilde">~</span>/now.md</p>
    <div class="index-header__line">
      <h1 data-split>Now</h1>
      <p>updated 2026.10.31</p>
    </div>
    <p class="index-header__description">当前工作、待验证项与近期关注。</p>
  </header>

  <div class="now-page shell">
    <section data-reveal>
      <p class="now-page__label">01 / building</p>
      <h2>正在做</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>有径：完成 AI 行程的 Schema 校验、Map Kit 落点与 RDB v6 迁移，执行 79 条真机用例，仓库见 <a href="https://github.com/2697881905/YouJing">GitHub</a>。</li>
        <li>有据：复查三段信息流的缓存、点赞态同步与 <a href="/posts/youju-harmonyos-engineering/">Push 深链</a>。</li>
        <li>MindType：整理验证码 TTL、短信限流与支付掉单补偿的实现，记录在 <a href="/posts/redis-boundary/">Redis 笔记</a>。</li>
        <li>本站：将 Astro 构建与 <a href="/posts/astro-nginx-deploy/">Nginx 发布</a>流程整理为可回滚步骤。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section data-reveal>
      <p class="now-page__label">02 / learning</p>
      <h2>正在学</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/posts/harmonyos-arkts-state/">ArkUI：@Builder 值快照、ForEach key、List 复用和深色模式下的材质</a>。</li>
        <li><a href="/posts/redis-boundary/">Redis：TTL、一次性校验、单机限流与多实例的差别</a>。</li>
        <li><a href="/posts/mysql-index-design/">MySQL：用 EXPLAIN 和真实参数分布决定联合索引</a>，不凭感觉。</li>
        <li><a href="/posts/astro-nginx-deploy/">Astro：静态产物的缓存分层和回滚</a>。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section data-reveal>
      <p class="now-page__label">03 / setup</p>
      <h2>日常工具</h2>
      <div class="now-page__stack">
        <span>DevEco Studio</span><span>IntelliJ IDEA</span><span>VS Code</span><span>Docker</span><span>Nginx</span><span>MySQL</span><span>Redis</span><span>Prisma</span><span>Git</span><span>Astro</span><span>Figma</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section data-reveal>
      <p class="now-page__label">04 / elsewhere</p>
      <h2>更多入口</h2>
      <div class="now-page__links">
        {profile.socialLinks.map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href} target={link.href.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined} rel="noreferrer">
            {link.label.toLowerCase()} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        ))}
        <a href="/posts/">notes/ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .now-page li a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .now-page li a:hover {
      color: var(--accent-strong);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
